WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:19.889
This is the Daily Karma. Today’s practice is compassion: strength with warmth. Find a supported position. Let your eyes close, or rest gently on the painting.

2
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:41.056
Notice the weight of your body being held. Let the tongue rest and the shoulders fall. Allow this moment to ask nothing from you.

3
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:08.217
Notice one breath arriving and one breath leaving. Do not improve it. Let each breath return you to the direct experience of this moment.

4
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:33.288
Compassion joins clear seeing with the wish to reduce suffering. It is warmth with boundaries, courage, and practical action.

5
00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:00.288
Picture a lantern beside a dark path. It does not light the whole journey. It offers enough warmth and clarity for the next few steps.

6
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:29.706
Notice what your body is doing with these words. Soften around the eyes, the hands, and the belly. Keep only the effort needed to stay present.

7
00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:56.313
Notice the person within you who has been working hard. Speak inwardly with the same steadiness you would offer a trusted friend.

8
00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:25.381
I will leave some quiet here. You do not need to empty the mind. Notice what appears, release the story, and return to breathing.

9
00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:04.892
Still here. Still breathing. Nothing special needs to happen. This quiet awareness is already a useful way of meeting your life.

10
00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:26.381
Let one choice today combine strength with warmth. Be direct without becoming hard. Be kind without abandoning what matters.

11
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:52.288
Take one fuller breath. Feel the space beyond your body and let your eyes open in their own time. Thank you for practicing with Karma.
